    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "Create a personalized welcome email for a new employee:\n\nEmployee Name: {{ $json.first_name }} {{ $json.last_name }}\nJob Title: {{ $json.job_title }}\nDepartment: {{ $json.department }}\nManager: {{ $json.manager.name }}\nStart Date: {{ $json.start_date }}\nLocation: {{ $json.location }}\nWork Email: {{ $json.work_email }}\n\nThe email should:\n1. Welcome them warmly to the company\n2. Provide their new work email and temporary password instructions\n3. Outline what to expect on their first day\n4. Mention the onboarding documents they need to complete\n5. Introduce their manager\n6. Provide helpful resources and contacts\n\nTone: Warm, professional, and excited. Make them feel valued.",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are an HR specialist creating personalized onboarding communications. Write engaging, informative welcome messages."
        }
      },
