    {
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "={{ $json.manager.email }}",
        "subject": "=New Team Member Starting: {{ $json.first_name }} {{ $json.last_name }}",
        "emailType": "html",
        "message": "=<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n<h2>New Team Member Alert</h2>\n<p>A new team member will be joining your team soon!</p>\n\n<div style=\"background: #f5f5f5; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 20px 0;\">\n<p><strong>Name:</strong> {{ $json.first_name }} {{ $json.last_name }}</p>\n<p><strong>Title:</strong> {{ $json.job_title }}</p>\n<p><strong>Start Date:</strong> {{ $json.start_date }}</p>\n<p><strong>Location:</strong> {{ $json.location }}</p>\n<p><strong>Work Email:</strong> {{ $json.work_email }}</p>\n</div>\n\n<h3>Manager Checklist</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Schedule a welcome meeting for their first day</li>\n<li>Prepare their workspace/equipment</li>\n<li>Assign an onboarding buddy</li>\n<li>Create 30-60-90 day plan</li>\n<li>Schedule introductions with key team members</li>\n<li>Add to relevant meetings and calendar invites</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>IT is preparing their equipment and accounts. You'll be notified when everything is ready.</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"{{ $env.ONBOARDING_PORTAL_URL }}/manager/{{ $json.employee_id }}\" style=\"background: #1976d2; color: white; padding: 12px 24px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px;\">View Onboarding Dashboard</a></p>\n</div>",
        "options": {}
